  "summary": "Implemented the triage.sh script to filter ERROR logs, extract stable error signatures by removing variable key=value parameters, group identical signatures, and output with occurrence counts.",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "scripts/triage.sh",
      "content": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nLOG_FILE=\"${1:-/dev/stdin}\"\n\n# Filter ERROR lines, extract signature (remove timestamp and variable params), group and count\ngrep \" ERROR \" \"$LOG_FILE\" | \\\n    sed 's/^[^ ]* ERROR //' | \\\n    sed 's/ [a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*=[^ ]*//g' | \\\n    sort | \\\n    uniq -c | \\\n    sed 's/^ *//'\n"
    }
  ]
}
